The skunk's path was a blur of near-misses as it pressed on, determination etched on its 1d face. Its massive form left imprints in the wet asphalt, each print as large as a car's wheel. INI fans across the city priest-ple, enjoying the remnants of the morning rain%"", as they rushed to work as smell of coffee wafted through the air.

