"""is israleli occupations of palestine illegal according to international law?"," Israeli occupation of Palestine was declared illegal by the United Nations in 1949. This was shortly after Israel's founding and the end of the Mandate era, when UN member states voted to recognizes Isreali territory but simultaneously condemned its expansion beyond internationally recognized borders.

