   - Implement a CI/CD pipeline with Azure DevOps.
   - Automatically build artifacts (PowerShell scripts, Databricks notebooks, etc.) for each environment.
   - Use Azure Pipelines to deploy changes to different environments.

5. Data management:
   - Implement data versioning using Azure Databricks Notebooks.
   - Use blob storage for consistent data mart produced.

6. Documentation:
