2. Set up queues and concurrency:
   - Create your worker configuration
   - Add `worker'` configurations to your celery app
   - Set `worker_concurrency` to a value other than_defaults (e.g., `worker_concurrency=4`)
   - Add `queue` argument to your Celery worker launcher

3. Configure message broker:
   - Set `worker` option to `True` in Celery worker launcher
