"""explain to me like i am five: what is elo rating?",""". An elo rating is like a special number that tells us how good a player is at a game. Imagine you're playing a board game with your friends. Some players might be better than others.

The Elo rating gives us a way to compare how skilled different players are. It's like a grade for games!

If a player has a high Elo rating, it means they're really good at the game. They might win most of their matches against other players with lower Elo ratings.

But here's the fun part - even if a player has a lower Elo rating, they might still sometimes win against players with higher ratings. It's like when you play with your younger sister; you might win even though she's younger!

Elo ratings help us understand who's good at what, and it makes it fair when we play games against each other."
