"""how are salted and roasted peantus made"""," - exploring these classic snack foods

Salted and roasted peanuts are a staple snack that many people enjoy. The process of making these peanuts involves several steps. First, the peanuts are shelled and sort to remove any imperfections. They are then dry roasted in a large vat or roaster until they develop a warm, nutty color and a slightly smoky flavor from the oil rendered during roasting.

