"""How to get from Glasgow to London?"," What's the best way to get there? How long will it take? These are common questions asked by travelers planning a trip from Scotland's largest city to England's capital.

There are several options to travel between Glasgow and London:

1. by train (3.5-4 hours)
2. by bus (6-7 hours)
3. by plane (1 hour)

