In manufacturing, one of the sectors most likely to be impacted by automation, I observe a more balanced gender distribution. While still primarily male, there's a growing number of women in these roles.

It's crucial to remember that these trends are evolving rapidly. The gender disparity in automation-affected industries can vary greatly depending on the specific country, region, and even within individual organizations.

