   14 women × 28 babies ÷ (2 women × 1 baby) = 14 × 28 ÷ 2 = 196 ÷ 2 = 98

3. So, 98 months or 8 years and 2 months

Therefore, it would take 14 women 98 months or 8 years and 2 months to have 28 babies."""
