"""if you were a rating agency specialised in Travel , How would you compare TUI travel and Expedia, what grade would they get ?"," and why? ？""
As a travel ratings agency, I would compare TUI travel and Expedia as follows:

TUI travel receives a grade of A-.

 Expedia earns a grade of B+.

TUI travel gets the slightly higher grade due to its stronger brand recognition, wider range of services including package holidays and cruises, and established presence in the bricks-and-mortar travel agency market. TUI's comprehensive travel offerings and larger workforce allow them to provide a more diverse and potentially more personalized service to customers.

Expedia, on the other hand, earns a B+ for its strength in online travel bookings and its focus on flight and hotel packages. While Expedia offers competitive prices and convenient booking options, it may lack the same level of physical presence and hands-on support as TUI.

Both companies have their merits, but TUI's more robust travel ecosystem gives them the edge in this comparison."
