owded. Still worth it.  \\"",\\n   \\""review_9\\"":\\""The overall experience was good. The main pool was closed for repairs. We wouldn't have stayed they if we knew that. Not enough food \\tselections. The resort fee is too high \\""\\n}\\n```"""," To summarize these reviews, I'll create a list of the positive aspects and negative aspects mentioned across all reviews:

