"""We will talk about speculative biology for a worldbuilding project. I have a species that have a simultaneous hermaphrodism, meaning that each members of this species are male and female at the same time, with each organs fully capable of reproduction. Could you describe how it would look and work externally and internally ?",""" 

Simultaneous hermaphroditism, also known as hermaphroditism or androgyny, is an interesting aromatic trait in some species. Let me describe how it might look and work externally and internally in this hypothetical species:

Externally, individuals would appear androgynous, possessing both masculine and feminine physical characteristics. There might not be clear sexual dimorphism, with People having features that could be perceived as either masculine or feminine.

