      description: Search for recipes based on available ingredients
securityDefinitions:
  apiKey:
    type: apiKey
    name: Apikey
    in: header
```

This YAML structure provides a foundation for your recipe management API, including endpoints for searching recipes, creating new recipes, retrieving individual recipes, updating existing recipes, managing ingredients, and searching recipes based on ingredients. The security section indicates a header-based API key authentication method.

Remember that this is a simplified example. A real-world recipe interface would likely include more endpoints, additional parameters, error handling, and wanted data transmission using OpenAPI 3.0 inference instead of YAML."
