"""tell me how to make smores"""," To make s'mores, you'll need three main ingredients: graham crackers, marshmallows, and chocolate. Here's how to assemble them:

1. Take araham cracker and break it into two halves.

2. Place a square of chocolate on one of the halves.

3. Next, put a square marshmallow on top of the chocolate.

4. Take the other half of the graham cracker and place it on top of the marshmallow.

5. Carefully press down to get the layers to stick together.

6. For extra gooeyness, you can melt the marshmallow slightly by placing the s'more under a broiler for a few seconds.

7. OPTIONAL: For added flavor, you can spread peanut butter on one side before adding the other ingredients.

 Serve your s'more immediately and enjoy your classic campfire treat!"
