"""chimpanzee is a monkey?"," true or false""
False. While chimpanzees are indeed monkeys, the statement as presented is incorrect. Chimpanzees are primates, not just monkeys. They belong to the suborder Homininae, which includes humans and shows a close evolutionary relationship with our species. Monkeys are a broader category of primates that do not necessarily include chimpanzees or humans."
