"""In the year 2000, how much older is George (born in 1950) than Herb (born in 1960)?","""
George was born in 1950, and Herb was born in 1960.
The difference in their birth years is 1960 - 1950 = 10 years.
Therefore, George was born 10 years earlier than Herb."
