"""Hello"",""Can you give me a simple unity code to move a 3D character with a point and click system using navmesh?",""",""Yes, I can provide you with a simple Unity code example for moving a 3D character using a point-and-click system with NavMesh. Here's a basic outline of the code:

using UnityEngine;
using UnityNav;
 using NavMeshAgent;
public transform target;
