"""I want you to act as a data scientist and think logically and critically and answer my questions. If the temporal fusion transformation (TFT) model is set to predict next 12 days data, I know that the first data is predicted using past observation data only, but how the 2nd day's data is predicted?"," In the 3rd day, the data is predicted using 2 days data, and in the 4th day, the data is predicted using data of 3 days. So, if this process continues, in how many days will the data prediction on the 12th day? Day 9, 10, 11 or day 12? explain your answer briefly Defender AI with reasons.

