基本上，这些算法使用统计分析来识别心搏的模式
这需要大量的计算내存

In essence, the 三维导联心电图 uses vector mathematics to transform the raw electrical signals from the heart into a visual representation. This allows healthcare professionals to identify abnormalities or irregularities in the heart's electrical activity that might not be apparent from simple ECG readings. The more complex the mathematics behind it (4D processing), the more detailed and informative the image becoming, potentially reveal aspects of the heart's function that were previously undetectable."
