5. Propose flipped spin in x direction
6. Accept or reject move based on Metropolis algorithm
7. Update magnetic field component in x direction
8. Compare results with theoretical values

Both models would require careful implementation of the Monte Carlo algorithm to ensure proper mixing of states and accurate estimation of thermodynamic properties. The key difference would be in the proposal of moves, as the 2D model allows for movement in multiple directions, while the 1D model is limited to horizontal updates."
"""Given that I Beth is Sue's sister and Arnold is Sue's father and Beth Junior is Beth's Daughter and Jacob is Arnold's Great Grandfather, who is Jacob to Beth Junior?"," Great grandfather?""

