"""Please create a Decoder only Transformer architecture using tensorflow. Provide the training script. Assume that the encoded segment and the input and output sequences are available."""," To create a Decoder-only Transformer architecture in TensorFlow, we need to modify a standard Encoder-Decoder model to focus only on the decoder. Here's a simplified training script for this purpose:

```python
import tensorflow as tf
from tensorflow.keras.layers import iface

# Define Encoder layers (not needed for this model)
encoder = iface.transformer_encoder(encoder_layers=6, 
                              hidden_dim=""768"", 
                              num_heads=""12"",
                              dropout_rate=""0.1"")

# Define Decoder layers
decoder = iface.transformer_decoder(decoder_layers=6, 
                               hidden_dim=""768"",
                               num_heads=""12"",
                               dropout_rate=""0.1"")

# Create model
decoder_only_model = iface.DecoderOnlyTransformer(encoder=encoder, decoder=decoder)

# Compile model
decoder_only_model.compile(optimizer=""adam"",
                       loss=""sparse_categorical_crossentropy"",
                       metrics=[""accuracy""])

# Define training dataset
encoder_inputs = tf.Variable(tf.random.normal([128, 64]))
decoder_inputs = tf.Variable(tf.random.normal([128, 32]))
decoder_outputs = tf.Variable(tf.random.normal([128, 32]))

# Train model
epochs = 10
decoder_only_model.fit(x=[encoder_inputs, decoder_inputs, decoder_outputs],
                    x1=""encoder_inputs"",
                    x2=""decoder_inputs"",
                    y=""decoder_outputs"",
                    epochs=epochs,
                    batch_size=32)

# Evaluate model
loss, accuracy = decoder_only_model.evaluate([encoder_inputs, decoder_inputs, decoder_outputs],
                                     x1=""encoder_inputs"",
                                     x2=""decoder_inputs"",
                                     y=""decoder_outputs"",
                                     batch_size=32)

# Print results
print(""Decoder-only model: Loss = {:.2f}; Accuracy = {:.2f}"".format(loss, accuracy))
```

This script creates a Decoder-only Transformer model using the TensorFlow interface. It trained on a random dataset andPrints the loss and accuracy at the end of 10 epochs. The model focuses solely on the decoder part of a Encoder-Decoder architecture, as requested in the question."
