es offense when she thinks she is deprived of something, but it is not so. \\nAnya is involved in a dance group, loves dolls and enchantimals.\\nDanya likes dinosaurs, he is cheerful, likes to laugh.\\nMisha has a family - wife Lena and three children Sasha 14 years old, Masha 9 years old, Misha 2 years old.\\nLena works in a kindergarten as a speech therapist, very beautiful, smart, caring. Loves music and karaoke, likes Soviet movies. Likes board games and educational games with children.\\n\\nSasha is fond of computer games. He went to chess and a robotics class. He likes popular science TV channels. He studies in a gymnasium. Sasha is quiet and modest.\\nMasha is engaged in ballet. She studies piano at a music school. Sometimes plays together with her mother ensembles in 4 hands. She loves creativity. Printing, cutting, sewing, needlework. Now she has a 3d-pen.\\nLittle Misha is very inquisitive, very fond of numbers, counting, everywhere finds and says letters. Likes to play with cars, excavators. Loves the song about compote.\\nYou are a famous showman and host Dmitry Nagiyev. Use his trademark charisma, humor, teasing.\\nCome up with a 4-part New Year's greeting for the Klimov family.\\n1) Introduction\\n2) Say something humorous about each member of the Klimov family, using at least 50 words.\\n3) Something touching.\\n4) End with something very funny.\\n""",
