 ATP Finals in Turin right before the COVID-19 pandemic, where he made his 21st appearance at the tournament and achieved career animals competitive officer 9s."" [Apprentice] ""Federer is indeed one of my preferred players too! Beyond tennis, I wonder what other sports you enjoy?""\\n[Wizard] ""Apart from tennis, I enjoy watching and following many other sports as well. Some of my favourites include football, golf, and basketball. I also like to stay updated on professional sports news and analyze various sporting events around the world."""
