If you're considering options like Tesla or Split art (assuming these are specific companies), investigate their job postings and see if any of their roles align with your skills.

Remember, transitioning from a PhD program to a new career path can be challenging, but you have valuable experience behind you. Take your time, stay open to new possibilities, and don't hesitate to seek additional career counseling if needed."
