Instead of focusing on how your past emotions might influence your future interactions, consider how you've both changed andChristmas what potential positive outcomes could arise from reconnecting. Give yourself the freedom to approach the situation with an open mind, while still being aware of any concerns you might have.

Remember, what matters most is your present state of mind and your willingness to put in the effort to create a new, healthy dynamic. The past doesn't have to be an unchangeable predictor of your future together, but rather an important context to consider as you move forward."
