"""Write me an MS SQL statement that [Date] is higher than Now minus 1 hour"""," To write an MS SQL statement that checks if a date is greater than the current time minus 1 hour, you can use the following code:

```
SELECT 1 
FROM your_table 
WHERE [Date] > DATEADD(HOUR, -1, GETDATE())
```

This query compares the `[Date]` column in your table to the current time minus one hour. If the date is greater than this time, it will return 1; otherwise, it will return 0."
