"""I read 60 pages of a book on Monday and 1\\/4 of the book on Tuesday. I completed the remaining 1\\/8 of the book on Wednesday. How many total pages are in the book?"," Let's set up the equation:
x = total pages
1/8x = remaining pages after Tuesday
60 + 1/4x + 1/8x = x

Simplifying:
60 + 3/8x + 1/8x = x
60 + 4/8x = x
60 + 1/2x = x

Subtract 1/2x from both sides:
60 = 1/2x

Multiply both sides by 2:
120 = x

Therefore, there are 120 total pages in the book."""
