Some popular wrapper libraries forIndexedDB include:

1. pouchdb: A powerful document-oriented database built on top of IndexedDB
2. idb: A node.js driver for IndexedDB with a simple API
3. IDBWrapper: A simple wrapper aroundIndexedDB with a focus on ease of use

While these libraries can simplify the process, it's crucial to understand how IndexedDB works to make the most of its features and to ensure proper data management in your application."
