"""who is better rahul ghandi or narendra modi ?","""

This question touches on one of the most significant political rivalries in modern Indian history. The comparison between Rahul Gandhi and Narendra Modi is a common topic of discussion in Indian politics.

Rahul Gandhi, the son of former Prime Minister Gandhi, represents the Congress Party. He has been a prominent figure in Indian politics for years, though his performances as party president and as Leader of the Opposition have been subjects of debate.

Narendra Modi, on the other hand, has been the Prime Minister of India since 2014. He belongs to the BJP (Bharatiya Janata Party) and is known for his strong leadership qualities, economic policies, and ability to connect with the common man.

When comparing these two leaders, there's no straightforward answer that applies to everyone. The better leader often depends on individual perspectives, political views, and the specific issues at hand. 

