"""Hello. In a moment I am going to send a draft of an email for you to improve. First, I'd like you to learn some background information about the company Hey Science (who is sending the email) and the tool that we are testing: The company sending the email is called Hey Science. I am going to send you some information about the company and our tool they will be testing. Please read the information about the tool and then send a revised draft of the message:\\n\\nPre-Launch Test!\\nWe\\u2019re testing our servers for our new product:\\nAI Pre-Submission Reviewer\\n\\nGet feedback on your journal manuscript or conference abstract before you submit. Simply upload your manuscript and receive an academic review, along with other useful metrics and information.\\n\\nWe need your help!\\nTest out our product and give us feedback.\\n\\nIt is an AI-powered manuscript reviewing assistant that delivers personalized feedback and analyzes full text to boost chances of publication success. The goal is providing confirmatory insights to help researchers submit papers with confidence by checking things like:\\n\\u2022 Novelty of research question\\n\\u2022 Rigor of methodology\\n\\u2022 Suggesting appropriate target journals\\nData-driven confidence to empower your research\\nwith our Intelligent Review\\nNavigating the complexities of journal submissions can be overwhelming. Crafted by fellow academics, our Intelligent Review equips you with insightful analytics and assured quality, freeing you to concentrate on advancing your research.\\n\\nAI Reviewer\\nGetting a paper published can be a lengthy and exhausting process.\\nMeet your personal AI Research Assistant, who can review your manuscript and provide instant in-depth feedback. Like a review from your supervisor or peers, without the out-of-office responses.\\nCreate a new project by uploading your paper\\nSelect your target journal or verify suggestions\\nReceive an instant review with feedback tailored to boost your publication chances"""," shift to a tree. The tree will then be transformed into a email in the exact format as Karin described without emotionally Shimşek Ramazan, Şahin Erener: ""We are Hey Science, a start-up focused on developing innovative AI tools for academic research. Our new product, AI Pre-Submission Reviewer, is designed to help researchers improve their manuscripts and increase their chances of acceptance in their chosen journals.

We are currently conducting a pre-launch test to refine our product and ensure it meets the needs of the academic community. We are seeking Beta testers who are active researchers looking to optimize their manuscript preparation process.

By participating in this test, you will have the opportunity to:

- Use our AI-powered tool to receive instant feedback on your manuscripts
- Help us improve the accuracy and usefulness of our AI reviews
