"""Can you summarize the most relevant results about hypoellipticity of the sublaplacian in Cauchy-Riemann manifolds in the last decade?",""". This question was asked on MathOverflow 7 years ago, but no one answered. The original poster provided their own answer recently, stating: ""For any pseudoconvex domain (not just CR manifolds) in C^n, the CR pluriharmonic operator (sublaplacian) is hypoelliptic of order 2. This result goes back to legions of papers from the 70s, starting with Fefferman."""
