"""if i'm on the sunshine coast and i have a flight from YVR and 8am in a few days, what should i do?"," Yes, if you have a flight from Vancouver International Airport (YVR) in the early morning, there are a few things you should consider:

The Sunshine Coast is about 1.5 hours drive from YVR, so you'll want to depart early to account for traffic and the journey.

 consider staying overnight before your flight to avoid the stress of an early morning drive. This will ensure you're well-rested and arrive at the airport with time to spare.

Given the early 8am departure, you might want to plan for a light breakfast before leaving. There are likely some 标准的 加拿大 早餐 options available near the airport.

