5. Mindfulness meditation: focusing on the present moment without judgment.""

6. Regular exercise: physical activity can help reduce stress and improve mood.

7. Stress management techniques: such as time management, setting priorities, and avoiding overcommitment.

8. Seeking support: talking to a therapist, counselor, or support group.

