Large buttons received = 51.5 * 0.5 = 25.75
Small buttons received = 63 - 25.75 = 37.25

Total buttons = 103 + 25.75 + 37.25 = 165. sink
133.33 sink sink

This calculation shows Lorraine ends up with 166.33 buttons in total, not 116 buttons as originally stated."
