"""i have three years of video editing experience and intermediate skills. what\\u2019s a good online course for me to take to improve my skills that won\\u2019t be too basic"""," As someone with three years of video editing experience and intermediate skills, you're likely looking for online courses that can help you take your skills to the next level without being too basic. Here are some suggestions:

