"""Explain like I'm 5. What is Inference in LLM?"," I need a simple answer.""

Inference is when a big, brainy computer figures out something new based on what it's been told. It's like when you play connects-the-dots, but with words and numbers instead. The computer looks at all the information it has, including its own thoughts and learning, to make sense of things. It's how it learns and understands the world around it, just like how you might figure out that your trains and boats are different even though they both move you from place to place."
