 and diverse team.\\nWe are looking for a Data Professional - Analytics & AI (f\\/m\\/d) to join our E.ON Digital Technology GmbH team. \\nDo you love data and technology?"," Are you an expert in analytics and AI? Then this could be the perfect opportunity for you!\\nWhat you will do:\\n\\n- Provide expert advice on complex analytics and AI solutions\\n- Work on diverse projects related to data lakes, AI models, and machine learning applications\\n- Collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver innovative data-driven business value\\n- Celebrate diversity and inclusivity in a highly professional and recognizable team\\n\\nWe are offering you an exciting career perspective in the E.ON Digital ecoystem. If you are ready to make a difference in the energy transition and contribute to creating a greener future through technology, apply now!\\n\\nE.ON Digital Technology is your gateway to a career where you can truly impact change. We guide our customers through their digital transformation, reflecting E.ON's commitment to making energy more accessible, reliable, and sustainable for all.\\n\\nArea of responsibility: You will join our Analytics & AI team within the Technology Consulting division. Your primary focus will be on providing expert advice and delivering sophisticated AI and data-driven solutions hierarchical to various sectors within E.ON's business units. You will be working closely with other technology experts to develop cutting-edge products and services thatoved in the energy transition.\\n\\nThis position offers a unique blend of professional development opportunities, exposure to the latest technologies, and the chance to contribute to E.ON's significant role in shaping the future of energy。\\n\\nE.ON Digital Technology - Where cutting-edge technology meets transformation。\\n\\nApply now and be part of our team that's writing the future of energy!\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\