Regarding life after death, different religions and philosophies have different beliefs. For some, there might be an afterlife or a spiritual existence beyond our physical form. For others, the focus might be on making the most of our present life. Many people find comfort in the idea of leaving a legacy or impacting others in some way as a way of continuing to engage with the world even after their physical death.

