"""what is bigger 2 in power of 9 or 3 in power of 6?","!""

The result of 3 to the power of 6 is larger than 2 to the power of 9.

To break it down:

3^6 = 3 × 3 × 3 × 3 × 3 × 3 = 729
2^9 = 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 = 512

729 is greater than 512, so 3^6 is bigger than 2^9."
